{"data": [{"author_id": "1395851729523068928", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:34:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120268799651770549"], "id": "2120268799651770549", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen Video that responds? Interesting. Isolated sub-accounts for agents. https://t.co/0OlExtvBOz", "url": "https://x.com/Eterna_Hybrid/status/2120268799651770549"}, {"author_id": "1587673526177144832", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:18:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120264885057519966"], "id": "2120264885057519966", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen Real-time video that responds changes selling: I make dozens of AI shorts daily, and every clip is one-way. If a shopper could ask a question and the video answered live, conversion would jump. What latency do you see — can it keep up with a sales chat?", "url": "https://x.com/clyve2022/status/2120264885057519966"}, {"author_id": "1601974659322445824", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:15:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120233905529782408"], "id": "2120233905529782408", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen Video that reacts to the viewer could change how brands think about ads. Excited to see where Labs takes this.", "url": "https://x.com/Ty3_Buya/status/2120233905529782408"}, {"author_id": "1809442497938223105", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:48:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120227099374194733"], "id": "2120227099374194733", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen Training video feels like the obvious first use. A safety or onboarding piece that changes based on the viewer's role would beat shooting five versions. How do you keep continuity when the video is generated on the fly?", "url": "https://x.com/Mediajumphq/status/2120227099374194733"}, {"author_id": "2117342934135910400", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:41:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120225276022202772"], "id": "2120225276022202772", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen Imagine combining real-time video with interactive storytelling and creative collaboration. This could open up entirely new ways to create experiences, not just traditional videos. Fascinating direction! 👀", "url": "https://x.com/AdveraLabs/status/2120225276022202772"}, {"author_id": "1896668083101773824", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:36:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120223992154046758"], "id": "2120223992154046758", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen Video that responds to you is a wild idea. Does the latency feel instant enough that it stops feeling like generating and starts feeling like interacting?", "url": "https://x.com/AdamTestsAI/status/2120223992154046758"}, {"author_id": "870951755965661184", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:32:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120223136654487820"], "id": "2120223136654487820", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen One creative, multiple formats, and different languages — all in one workflow. This makes content production faster, easier, and more flexible!", "url": "https://x.com/Nely_Brooks/status/2120223136654487820"}, {"author_id": "1838558231590830080", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:26:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120221554214838699"], "id": "2120221554214838699", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen Video that responds to you in real time could change online learning a lot. Would you rather learn from a reactive AI video or a live teacher?", "url": "https://x.com/Righteousbeing7/status/2120221554214838699"}, {"author_id": "16539573", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:52:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120213067116265930"], "id": "2120213067116265930", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1001114465692200960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120199384709353583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@runwayml @Ryan__Stephen How do we play with this drawing app?", "url": "https://x.com/Jonathan360/statu